Scope — third-party models are not covered
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The license above covers the suslik source code.

It does not cover the pre-trained models that ship inside the published
container images. Those belong to their respective authors and carry their own
terms, which are in places stricter than this license — in particular, the
InsightFace "buffalo_l" model pack is released by its authors for
non-commercial research purposes only. Nothing above grants you rights to
those files that their authors have not granted.

See the NOTICE file for the components, their authors and their terms. If you
plan to use suslik commercially, read NOTICE before you rely on the permission
to "sell" granted above: it applies to our code, not to the bundled models.
